WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.560
Sugane, we're counting on you.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.310
Okay.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.950
Also, the newbie's starting today.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:23.980
Understood.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.980
I'll be going, then.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.960
All right. Take care.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:36.720
What is the matter?

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.890
I have a stomach ache.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.750
Please stay calm and look 
at the information.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.610
Would you like to match? 
Yes     No

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.850
Excuse me, you should 
give her your seat.

00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:58.450
Huh?

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:02.770
What the hell?

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.440
The jerk thinks he's so cool.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.440
Thank you.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:05.320
No problem.

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:18.760
<i>"Target is on the move toward 
Tachikawa station."</i>

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.560
It is as stated in the prophecy.

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:31.760
<i>"There will be moving steps 
south-southwest of the box."</i>

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.910
Tachikawa Station North Exit

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:39.620
Steps?

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:52.180
<i>"A nameless chaos shall 
appear once more."</i>

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:56.540
<i>Target has passed the fourth floor.</i>

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.490
I'm counting on you, Sugane...

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.320
All right! Let's do this!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.160
So... cute...

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:34.750
There she goes again.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.380
Hajime really likes her planners.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.720
She's always fiddling with them.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.820
Look! I got another one yesterday!

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:44.690
What?!

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:48.340
What are you going to do with so many?

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.980
Well, you see,

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.270
this one is for planning school stuff.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.350
This one is for planning 
personal stuff,

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:56.610
and this one's for writing 
down random thoughts.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.260
As for this one, he's just to admire.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.110
"He"?

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.920
As for this newbie,

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:07.660
I wonder how I should pretty you up...

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.620
What?

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.840
Oh, if that's the case...

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.800
Hey, why don't we go 
lie in the sun together?

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:22.040
Hey, did you see yesterday's 
TV special on the supernatural?

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.540
Yeah, I did.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.650
I can accept aliens,

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.170
but Gatchaman being real?

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.000
It totally threw me off.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.280
Gatchaman, huh?

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.570
The name sounds kind of cute.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:48.050
Gatcha, Gatcha, Gatcha, Gatcha.

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.540
Man, I'm hungry.

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:13.600
Um, who are you?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:14.770
You're really tall.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:20.400
Everyone has power that 
is concealed deep within.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:26.820
Awaken!

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:30.270
Spread your as-of-yet 
invisible wings...

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.530
Oops.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:34.330
Is this hide-and-seek?

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.710
Hm...

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:36.830
This way?

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.340
This way!

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:43.470
All right, I'll get it right this time.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.480
You're making me think you're there,

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.970
but you're <i>there</i>!

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.020
Gotcha!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.580
The chosen fledglings 
will become the wings

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.440
that will protect this planet.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.220
Wings, thy name is...

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.690
...Gatchaman...

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:51.520
Gatcha... man?

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:58.330
H-Hey, I can keep this?

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:02.210
Hey, I'm gonna keep it!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.020
Yay!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.970
Target is on the move 
toward Tachikawa station.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.970
There will be moving steps 
south-southwest of the box.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.970
A nameless chaos shall 
appear once more.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.970
Target has passed the fourth floor.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:11.970
I'm counting on you, Sugane...

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.600
Uh, this is kind of awesome.

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:21.650
I think I'm gonna get full!

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:27.400
There you are, MESS.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.890
You have absorbed innocents.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:32.310
I will have you relinquish them to me!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.330
Amnesia Effect!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.900
Wow!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.130
So cute!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:52.640
Go, Bird!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.520
Let's go!

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.970
There you are!

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.180
Gatchaman!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.250
The Infinite Blade, Storm!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:28.100
None may escape my infinite reach!

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:40.770
Amnesia Remind!

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:47.850
Ow!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.520
Hi!

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:52.150
Are you the Gatchaman I just saw?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.110
What happened to him?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:57.490
This NOTE has words 
flooding out of it—

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:57.490
Could you be...

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.700
the new team member?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.380
I'm Ichinose Hajime!

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.420
I think I somehow became 
a Gatchaman today.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.830
Nice to meet you!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.500
Oh! We're in the same school!

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.050
Let's go together!

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.530
Ow!

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:14.850
Sorry!

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.670
<i>I guess I'm late again today.</i>

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:49.000
<i>I wonder if I'll pass my classes okay.</i>

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.400
"Morning," Sugane-kun.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.600
Late again, too.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:58.880
Good afternoon.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:09:59.520
Oh?

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:05.240
Um, does Gatchaman really exist?

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.970
Of course not.

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:09.330
Although few and far between, 
some information exists.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.990
Oh, really?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.670
What? This is a panda.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.690
Nah, no way.

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.390
Gatchaman exists!

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.760
It's Senpai and me!

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:25.370
Listen!

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:26.420
Our identity as G—

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:30.230
Our identity is an absolute secret!

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:32.500
NOTE!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.950
So cute!

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:37.190
Wh-Why was such a joke chosen...

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.500
Come with me.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.580
We will go to our base now.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.660
Really?!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.330
It's within walking distance.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:46.620
That's surprisingly close.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.210
This is the entrance?

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.930
The base is underground?

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:05.930
Listen, newbie.

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.060
Oh, I'm Hajime.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:10.390
That's the last we'll 
see of your antics.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.440
The responsibilities of 
a Gatchaman aren't fun and games.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.170
You must always face them 
with a sense of tension.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.650
Understood.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.370
So Gatchaman do exist!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.000
Is it true you're protecting Earth?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.650
I'll introduce you to the team.

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:36.710
Hey.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.150
Where did you get your swimsuit?

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:43.120
The design's super cute!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.560
I'm gloomy...

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.830
Wow, you're super cute!

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:51.080
You're really too bold!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.190
I'm OD.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.270
Nice to meet you!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.950
OD-san, nice to meet you.

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:59.650
Well, I'm a sad Gatchaman 
who can't even transform.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.070
Sniff, sniff!

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.280
Oh, really?

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.610
Let's get along, okay?

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.290
This one's Altair.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.540
Al-chan.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.360
Cute!

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:13.780
Al-chan!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.210
Come on, Utsutsu.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.880
You're Utsutsu-chan?

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.050
Nice to meet you.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:19.590
The man over there's Jou-san.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.300
I pass.

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:22.790
Jou-san?

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:23.720
Nice to meet you.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:30.460
Ah, there you are.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:32.420
Welcome to the Gatchaman CAGE.

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:33.980
I'm the leader, Paiman.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:34.930
Huh, a panda?

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:37.710
Listen up, newbie.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.150
Oh, I'm Hajime.

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:43.280
Never mention that animal's name again.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.100
It is my most hated 
life form in existence.

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:48.320
The leader's command is absolute.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:51.820
Obey me at any cost, henceforth.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.110
So cute!

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.890
You're talking a lot!

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:56.610
Don't be so full of yourself, human!

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:59.880
I have, thus far,
 protected seven planets!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.330
Oh, so you are protecting Earth!

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.020
And you're so tiny!

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:04.840
I'm impressed!

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:07.130
First, I'll explain the NOTE to you.

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:09.220
Great! That's what I wanted to hear.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:13.890
The NOTE is the source 
of our Gatchaman powers.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:18.560
Everyone here had their NOTEs 
extracted from them by Lord JJ.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:21.260
"Source"? "JJ"?

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:24.470
Didn't you meet a tall guy?

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:25.990
Oh!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.590
So he's JJ.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:31.410
The NOTE is our spiritual essence.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.830
In other words, our soul itself!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.170
Our soul is our NOTE?

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.090
Awesome!

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.190
That's really fun!

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.730
We engage with the enemy on a daily basis,

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.450
but we must not be noticed by humans.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:46.230
Thus, we use our NOTE 
to cast the Amnesia Effect.

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:48.020
Amnesia Effect.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.180
Understood!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.240
You're a surprisingly quick study.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:55.220
Once you cast the Effect, 
humans become unable to see us.

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:58.020
But they can still feel you 
if you bump into them.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.110
So you have to avoid 
them while you fight.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:02.510
Understood!

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:06.940
Once you terminate the Effect, 
you'll also transform back to your normal self.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:10.090
Oh, but I saw Senpai 
at the station today.

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:13.740
The Amnesia Effect does 
not affect NOTE holders.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.620
I see!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:19.380
Oh, and you can use the NOTE 
to communicate, like a cell phone.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.920
If you input words or talk into it,

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:26.540
it's transmitted to the 
NOTEs of everyone else.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.600
Isn't it unreal?

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:29.960
It's way too convenient.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:32.980
Yeah, way too convenient!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:39.090
{cough cough}Deployment orders from Lord JJ 
will also be sent to your NOTE.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:43.040
Personal use of the NOTE's 
communication functions is strictly prohibited.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.420
They are for missions only.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:48.070
If Lord JJ learns of 
their personal use,

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:52.010
we would be turned to interstellar 
ashes and dust in a single gesture—

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.330
Loves bamboo in particular <3

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.760
H-How dare you...

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:03.420
On our sacred N-N-N-N-N-NOTE...

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.360
Sugane, I leave the rest to you!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.380
What?

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:19.510
This is how we transport the aliens 
we've captured from various places.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.190
So this is an alien?

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.220
It's pretty!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:24.680
No photos!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:26.790
Don't underestimate aliens!

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.530
Our leader is one, too.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.990
Really?!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.980
The Gatchaman's mission 
is to eradicate alien criminals and

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.180
unidentified objects that 
have infiltrated Earth.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.210
Eradicate?

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:41.370
Anything in existence that harms 
humans becomes our target.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.690
Recently, though, our targets 
have been mostly of this type.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.020
It's the thing you saw 
earlier this morning.

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:48.710
We call them MESS.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.760
"MESS"?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.800
It means discord and chaos.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:55.300
It destroys everything it touches 
with its long tentacles.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.710
The MESS will be our primary 
enemy for the time being.

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:59.960
Anything that appears 
in this area falls

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.390
under our jurisdiction 
and is eradicated by us.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.140
They are Big-Smalls.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:07.940
They are workforce clones that 
support our Gatchaman duties.

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.610
They are in charge of salvaging 
humans who have been absorbed

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:14.450
"Salvaging"? You mean rescuing?

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.520
Yes. We rescue them.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:19.630
Wow, they're back!

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.230
That's awesome.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.210
Their memories will be wiped later.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:26.870
Most people are salvaged that way,

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:30.190
but some remain missing.

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:32.040
I see.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.420
I wonder why MESS-chan 
does such things...

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.790
It's so cute.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:37.840
Newbie.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.220
Oh, I'm Hajime.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.930
From this point on, 
I would like you to carry out

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.490
your duties appropriately.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:48.610
We are protecting human lives 
on Earth from that dangerous object.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.040
Yeah?

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.610
Sugane, you've come a long way.

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:55.990
Whoa, here it comes!

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:58.010
Summons from Lord JJ.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:16:59.790
Whoa! What?

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:05.610
Wings of Six, gather at 
the Spiritual Precipice.

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.020
Oh!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.190
JJ! Thanks for earlier!

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:17.300
Watch your words!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:22.590
He's a transcendent being who's 
bestowed our powers upon us.

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:25.020
In other words, he is like a god.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.440
Wonderful scissors!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.440
Senpai, where are we?

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.070
We're at the Spiritual Precipice.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:35.010
It separates us from JJ, 
an insurmountable—

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:36.280
Hey, do you have a death wish?

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:41.540
Lord JJ, the G Team has assembled!

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.880
<i>A wind of disquiet nears,</i>

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:51.250
<i>but it cannot sway us, as of yet.</i>

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:55.260
<i>For now, contend with 
the nameless chaos.</i>

00:17:55.260 --> 00:18:00.260
<i>However, chaos and threat may 
not be one and the same.</i>

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.660
<i>The judgment is yours to make.</i>

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:06.100
What's this? A poem?

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:10.600
<i>The white-winged bird is not 
among you because it is lost.</i>

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:13.300
<i>Harden your resolve 
and await the next word.</i>

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.070
Gatcha!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.070
Gatcha!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.030
Fine, fine.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.320
Gatcha, Gatcha.

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:20.320
Gatcha!

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.490
Gatcha!

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.410
See you, JJ!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.370
Ow!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.750
Be more serious, newbie!

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:31.900
JJ?

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.290
"To the north,

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.130
beneath dragons racing 
in four directions,

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:38.200
the nameless chaos shall 
appear once more."

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.300
Let's go!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.550
H-He vanished!

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:47.860
Senpai, I'm coming!

00:18:58.490 --> 00:18:59.560
Senpai!

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.410
You're going too fast!

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.020
What'd he mean by "beneath dragons"?

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:08.020
"Dragons racing in four directions"...

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:12.580
Oh, that must be it! Beneath that.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:23.890
Amnesia Effect!

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:34.150
What?

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.820
This bus itself is probably the MESS.

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:40.880
Really?

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:50.160
They can camouflage themselves 
as all manner of things.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.170
Go, Bird!

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:20.970
Hey, newbie!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:22.570
If you can't act, just stay put!

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.750
All right, let's give this a try!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.510
Let's go, NOTE-chan!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.520
"Go"...

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.020
"...Bird"?

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.390
Got it!

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:26.800
That's...

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:31.440
Gatchaman

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:33.810
is here!

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:42.240
Gatcha... They're here!
